  "bodyHash": "54bl6J8bbdk=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:18px\"><strong>適用於 MC Forge 1.10.x、1.11.x 及 1.12.x 版本</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#808080\">支持 Animania！成為我們的 Patreon 贊助者！</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/purplicious_cow\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Purplicious_Cow</span>&nbsp;</a></span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/purplicious_cow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LGIXuQE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"38\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RazzleberryFox\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>RazzleberryFox</span>&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RazzleberryFox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LGIXuQE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"38\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>所有版本的 Animania 現在&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f90\">必須</span> 搭配 Craft Studio API 模組使用：&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftstudio-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftstudio-api</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>自 2.0.0 版本起，Animania 已拆分為多個擴充套件！若要獲得原有的 Animania 動物，您需要下載農場擴充套件和額外動物擴充套件！此外，所有設定檔都需要重新生成！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>請在此下載：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animania-extra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Animania 額外動物 - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animania-farm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Animania 農場 - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></strong></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>什麼是 Animania？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Animania 是一款沉浸式模組，取代並強化了 Minecraft 中的被動生物，新增多個品種、性別、新行為及數種新物種。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">請注意，本模組仍處於早期階段（可能存在錯誤）。請透過此處回報問題協助我們：&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/capnkirok/animania/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/capnkirok/animania/issues</a></span><br><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f60\"><strong>加入我們的 Discord：</strong></span> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7ne2Dqp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/7ne2Dqp</a><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>改進內容包括：</strong></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">更優質的模型、材質和動畫</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">動物需正確餵食與照料</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">改良繁殖系統與更真實的幼崽成長</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">更精準的行為與動作</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">新增且更優質的資源與產物</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>新增行為：</strong></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">動物需要持續獲得食物與水源才能保持快樂，部分動物（如豬）還需要遊樂場所（如泥坑）</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">若遭受攻擊，部分動物會長時間驚慌逃竄，並在您附近表現得更不可預測。其他動物可能反擊（如公牛）。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">若動物未進食或飲水，會變得不快樂。牠們會虛弱化、減少鳴叫，並散發煙霧粒子。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">動物僅在快樂時才會繁殖或掉落高級資源，因此請悉心照料動物與其環境。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">可透過裝滿水的飼槽、開放池塘或河流，或手動（用水桶）餵食飲水</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">動物會積極進食最愛的食物或從手持水桶飲水</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>即時狀態顯示：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請注意：在 1.11 和 1.12 版本中，WAILA 或 TOP 模組可顯示世界中的額外資訊，只需潛行狀態下查看動物或方塊即可。包括動物資訊如飢餓、口渴、懷孕、懷孕倒數計時、可剪毛、可擠奶、尋找巢穴、羊毛再生計時。方塊資訊可包含巢穴類型、RF 發電量（倉鼠輪）、飼槽內容物及剩餘量。</span><br></span></em></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>結交動物夥伴：</strong></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">新動物分布於主世界各處，根據物種與品種更精準地棲息於不同生態域（Animania 完全兼容生態域辭典及 Biomes O' Plenty 等模組）。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">只需餵食最愛食物即可與動物建立友誼。詳見下方動物類型說明。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">每個品種皆設有成就/進度。收集全部可獲得大獎。註：獎勵等同於您在遊戲中完成目標所獲得的滿足感。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">將持續新增物種與品種至遊戲中。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">所有動物皆可使用韁繩（您會需要它）。模組內含簡易韁繩合成配方。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">可輕鬆為動物命名。模組內含簡易命名牌合成配方（線 + 金粒）</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>模組兼容性：</strong></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 1.11 和 1.12 版本中，與 WAILA、TOP 和 JEI 深度整合，提供動物與物品的額外資訊。強烈建議搭配使用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過 Carry On 模組輕鬆搬運動物（該模組最初為 Animania 開發）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Animania 的牛、雞、馬延伸自原版生物，兼容 Cooking for Blockheads、Hatchery、Astikoor 等模組。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">兼容 Biomes o' Plenty 等世界生成模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">飼槽可自動化，並可與沉浸工程等具管道系統的模組協作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">遊戲中多數資源已註冊礦物辭典，應與 HarvestCraft 等模組兼容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Animania 生物仍會掉落原版物品與資源以供其他模組使用。您也可在設定中自訂各動物掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雖取代原版動物，但可透過設定保留原版生物。Animania 動物與原版動物相容良好。&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組包：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎於任何公開或私人模組包中使用本模組，無需通知或徵求我們同意。若為公開模組包，請註明 Purplicious_Cow 與 RazzleberryFox 並附回本論壇文章連結。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>實況影片：</strong></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lx9HT7688xE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>展示影片：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ANe60lrRuZ0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fZ070jOrwz8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_RpZdX5MAYE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>德語影片</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LOBNh3_trJY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><em><strong>棲地與雜項</strong></em></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>飼槽</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/animania/images/trough/trough.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飼槽合成配方</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/animania/images/recipes/trough_recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"140\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">飼槽目前可盛裝水、豬餿水或小麥</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">在 1.11 和 1.12 版本中，支援 Simple Corn 的玉米，及 HarvestCraft 的大麥與燕麥</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(1.11, 1.12) 飼槽可設定接受各種物品（來自任何模組），動物也可設定食用這些物品。</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">可手動放置物品或投擲至飼槽中</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">所有動物均可從飼槽飲水</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">豬、牛、馬、羊和山羊可從飼槽進食</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">飼槽兼容發射器與紅石比較器，便於自動化&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(1.11, 1.12) 飼槽還可連接管道、漏斗及物品欄操作模組&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(1.11, 1.12) 使用 WAILA 或 The One Probe 可顯示飼槽內容物的更多資訊，包括可用數量</span></li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>巢穴</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><strong>巢穴合成配方</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/animania/images/recipes/nest_recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"140\"></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">巢穴供雞隻產蛋，可用 1 羊毛、1 木棍和一些樹葉合成（需剪刀採集）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">雞隻僅在快樂時（已餵食飲水）才會產蛋</span></li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>泥巴</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">泥巴可用 1 泥土和水桶合成</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>泥巴合成配方</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/animania/images/recipes/mud_recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"140\"></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">泥坑至少需 2 x 3 大小以達最佳效果</span></li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>豬餿水</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">豬餿水可用牛奶桶任選以下兩種材料合成：麵包、馬鈴薯、胡蘿蔔、<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/animania/images/recipes/salt_lick_recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"139\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鹽磚</strong>可透過將一桶水倒入乳酪模具中，等待水分蒸發後製成。乳酪模具僅在安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animania-farm\" rel=\"nofollow\">農場擴充包</a>後可用。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><strong>牽繩</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Animania 中的所有動物均可使用牽繩</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當無法建造圍欄時，可暫時將動物繫於柱子上</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>牽繩合成配方</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/animania/images/recipes/lead_recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"140\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><strong>命名牌</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Animania 包含簡易的命名牌合成配方，方便標記動物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安裝 WAILA 模組後，潛行時可顯示已命名伴侀/親代的名称</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><strong>命名牌合成配方</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.creeptech.net/animania/images/recipes/nametag_recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"140\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>即將推出的功能</strong></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">小馬</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">鷹獵</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">綿羊</span></del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">（已於 1.3 版實裝）</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><del>山羊</del>（已於 1.3 版實裝）</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><del>貓</del>（已移至貓狗擴充包）</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">兔子</span></del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">（已於 1.3 版實裝）</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">狐狸</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">龍貓</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">其他鳥類</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">爬行動物</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><del>工作犬</del>&nbsp;（已移至貓狗擴充包）</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">鹽磚</span></del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">（已於 1.3 版實裝）</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\"><del>役用馬</del>（已於 1.2 版實裝）</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">刺蝟</span></del><span style=\"font-weight:400\">（已於 1.2 版實裝）</span></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>感謝我們的 Patreon 贊助者！</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Gunnar Kelley</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Stacy Hinojosa</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">LeKoopa</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Gold172</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Ltd_Webber</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Ice Kold</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Björn Herrström</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Tilt Parenting</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Joseph McVay</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Scott Radish</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Nicoloas Heather</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Sean</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">Mannya</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">CraftedLittlebit</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Elizabeth</span>&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>Animania 製作團隊</strong></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">原始構想：RazzleberryFox，靈感來自 Purplicious_Cow 與 cy4n</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">模型與實體材質：RazzleberryFox, Raptorfarian, JurassicAlien, vroulas,&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">物品材質、標誌與 Blender 渲染：cy4n</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">程式開發：Purplicious_Cow</span>&nbsp;與 Tschipp</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">動畫與 CraftStudio API：ZeAmateis 與 Timmypote</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雪貂模型：Wulfyk</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝 modochu 的開源倉鼠模組！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>在地化翻譯</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">衷心感謝所有貢獻者讓全球玩家能暢玩本模組！你們太棒了！</span></em></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">保加利亞語</span> <span style=\"font-weight:400\">@JohnArmyTweetin</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">丹麥語</span> <span style=\"font-weight:400\">Ruukas</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">德語</span> <span style=\"font-weight:400\">@derfl007 &amp;&nbsp;ACGaming </span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">西班牙語 @ivandpf（原始翻譯：@4karion）</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">芬蘭語</span> <span style=\"font-weight:400\">@ItsTehi</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">法語 @Phyapple</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:1